            "review_title": "Review at 30 Train Track Coffee",
            "review_text": "Emily Rose M\n17 contributions\n1\n30 train cafe Hanoi\nSep 2023 • Couples\nThis cafe is right next to an entry ramp. The owner Binh and his family were so kind and informative. They are very trusting in given accurate times for when the train is coming. The times Binh told us we’re very accurate, 21:20 & 22:05. Great view of the train. Had air conditioning. Free wifi which was very fast. Would highly recommend this place.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 18, 2023",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
