            "review_title": "Review at 30 Train Track Coffee",
            "review_text": "Heather R\nKingston-upon-Hull, United Kingdom36 contributions\n1\nLovely hosts great location\nSep 2022 • Friends\nWe where made to feel very welcome. Drinks lovely and cold and cheap. There's a train timetable and lucky we had very little time to wait. In fact we saw both.inward and outbound trains from the terrace only 2 feet away.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 1, 2022",
